  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For Hydrogen atom (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>) (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>)&nbsp;:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>&#8734;</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;...(1)</p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;atom (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>) :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;..(2)</p><p>From (1) &amp; (2)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>",
